OL,3,GNEWSABBC Scotland presenter Amy Irons
OL,4,Aexpecting first baby
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC Scotland presenter Amy Irons has
OL,7,Fannounced she is expecting her first
OL,8,Fbaby.
OL,10,FShe broke the news on BBC Radio
OL,11,FScotland's The Saturday Show which she
OL,12,Fpresents alongside co-host Steven Mill.
OL,14,FThe 35-year-old and her partner Elliot,
OL,15,F38, said they were thrilled to be
OL,16,Fwelcoming a baby boy.
OL,18,F"I'm delighted to be preparing for the
OL,19,Fmost important job I'll ever do," she
OL,20,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
